@@ -460,6 +460,10 @@ By default, the user will be prompted for an input if one was not passed
 through the command line. To turn this behavior off, see
 :ref:`optional-value`.
 
+When an option has a default value, the prompt displays it by default.
+Set ``show_default=False`` to hide it while still allowing an empty
+response to use the default.
+
 
